        content: `# Malignant Hyperthermia

## Recognition

### Signs
- Rising ETCO2 (often first)
- Unexplained tachycardia
- Muscle rigidity
- Hyperthermia (late)
- Arrhythmias
- Acidosis

## Treatment

### Immediate
1. STOP volatiles and succinylcholine
2. Call for help
3. MH Hotline: 1-800-644-9737
4. Hyperventilate 100% O2

### Dantrolene
- 2.5 mg/kg IV bolus
- Repeat every 5 min until stable
- May need up to 10 mg/kg

### Supportive
- Treat hyperkalemia
- Active cooling
- Treat arrhythmias
- Monitor for DIC`,
