        id: 'photo-2',
        title: 'Consent and Privacy',
        content: `# Photography Consent and Privacy

## Consent Requirements

### Separate Photography Consent
| Use | Consent Level |
|-----|---------------|
| Medical record | Implicit with treatment |
| Teaching | Explicit consent |
| Publication | Written specific consent |
| Marketing | Written specific consent |
| Website/social media | Written specific consent |

### Consent Form Elements
□ Purpose of photographs
□ Who will have access
□ How stored and secured
□ How long retained
□ Right to withdraw consent
□ Uses authorized (check boxes)
□ Signature and date

### Special Considerations
| Situation | Requirement |
|-----------|-------------|
| Minors | Parent/guardian consent |
| Sensitive areas | Extra privacy measures |
| Before/after sets | Consistent consent |
| Educational use | May de-identify |

## Privacy Protection

### During Photography
- Private room
- Limited personnel
- Draping appropriately
- Professional manner
- No personal devices (staff)

### Storage and Access
| Element | Requirement |
|---------|-------------|
| Storage | HIPAA-compliant system |
| Access | Limited to authorized |
| Encryption | Required for electronic |
| Backup | Secure backup system |
| Retention | Per medical record policy |

### Sharing/Publication
- Remove identifying information when possible
- Face blocking/masking if applicable
- Specific consent for identified images
- Watermarking for protection`,
